                         three base globals and does no mod-relative resolution, so an imageFilename
                         attribute cannot name a file this mod ships (5.80). Drawn white on transparent so
                         imageColor tints it. thruIcon IS in LAYOUT_KEEP_ASPECT_NAMES: it is a real picture
